(7113431, 1085750, 129807, '<td valign="top">Wow. Powerful. Personal. And a very well executed image. You have my utmost respect. I favourited this earlier, now I get to vote. 10. Easily. That''s for the story that you''ve shared. Thank you.</td>', 'Wow. Powerful. Personal. And a very well executed image. You have my utmost respect. I favourited this earlier, now I get to vote. 10. Easily. That''s for the story that you''ve shared. Thank you.', '2013-10-09 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
