(7113457, 1085317, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the elements here.</td>', 'Like the elements here.', '2013-10-09 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113521, 1085964, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! I wondered if I should have done Moffet &amp; Gatiss''s take - <i>A Study in Pink </i>for this. Nice to see a nod to Sherlock in the challenge:-) I do like the person studying the art piece on the wall - the art piece makes me think of the rooms/boxes we occupy or enclose ourselves in. Are they truly rosy or is that just how one perceives it as such.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! I wondered if I should have done Moffet & Gatiss''s take - A Study in Pink for this. Nice to see a nod to Sherlock in the challenge:-) I do like the person studying the art piece on the wall - the art piece makes me think of the rooms/boxes we occupy or enclose ourselves in. Are they truly rosy or is that just how one perceives it as such.', '2013-10-09 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113522, 1085718, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the pop of the pinks off the sky blue backdrop. The composition is colorful, pretty, and nicely detailed.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the pop of the pinks off the sky blue backdrop. The composition is colorful, pretty, and nicely detailed.', '2013-10-09 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113618, 1085753, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Well I nearly choked on my laughter when this popped up next on the vote screen. LOL - I think we can tell what this person is thinking:-) I like the humor that you injected in your Pink entry.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Well I nearly choked on my laughter when this popped up next on the vote screen. LOL - I think we can tell what this person is thinking:-) I like the humor that you injected in your Pink entry.', '2013-10-09 19:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113621, 1085980, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a stunning portrait of this young football player - the lighting the composition and the details are all top notch work! I think it might fair better in this color challenge if it was cropped closer as just a head shot of this little boy. That closer crop would have the pink color more prominent because the blue overpowers/overshadows the pink in the shot - this would do fabulous in a blue challenge:-). Again top notch work.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a stunning portrait of this young football player - the lighting the composition and the details are all top notch work! I think it might fair better in this color challenge if it was cropped closer as just a head shot of this little boy. That closer crop would have the pink color more prominent because the blue overpowers/overshadows the pink in the shot - this would do fabulous in a blue challenge:-). Again top notch work.', '2013-10-09 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113657, 1086051, 112828, '<td valign="top">Hi Wendy! ;)<br/> <br/>ROFL. Hi Not Wendy..  Seriously, how many people could actually have that identical crazy cool pitcher?<br/> <br/>ROFLMAOx3 Hello Wendy. :D</td>', 'Hi Wendy! ;) ROFL. Hi Not Wendy..  Seriously, how many people could actually have that identical crazy cool pitcher? ROFLMAOx3 Hello Wendy. :D', '2013-10-09 23:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113695, 1085609, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool glass, and nice pink fizzy drink!  I don''t think your dark border is helping you here, as it someone makes the glass appear ever so very slightly not perfectly centered and squared up.</td>', 'Cool glass, and nice pink fizzy drink!  I don''t think your dark border is helping you here, as it someone makes the glass appear ever so very slightly not perfectly centered and squared up.', '2013-10-10 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113696, 1085998, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite elegant.  Would make a nice cover of one of those romance novels.</td>', 'Quite elegant.  Would make a nice cover of one of those romance novels.', '2013-10-10 00:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113697, 1085490, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps more orange reddish than pink, but in the same color family.</td>', 'Perhaps more orange reddish than pink, but in the same color family.', '2013-10-10 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113698, 1086056, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very classic; tried and true.</td>', 'Very classic; tried and true.', '2013-10-10 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113699, 1085833, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting set up, nice message of providing the link.  Not sure why she''s in her undies, though, other than they''re sorta pinkish!  Nice tie in with the breast cancer ribbon shape.</td>', 'An interesting set up, nice message of providing the link.  Not sure why she''s in her undies, though, other than they''re sorta pinkish!  Nice tie in with the breast cancer ribbon shape.', '2013-10-10 00:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113701, 1086068, 30982, '<td valign="top">It seems it was once pink but is now a lovely melon color.</td>', 'It seems it was once pink but is now a lovely melon color.', '2013-10-10 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113702, 1085996, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too bright on the upper left of the photo - pulls the eye there.  Maybe diffuse the light a little?  I''m hopeless with artificial light, but there are those on DPC who are very good and are more than willing to assist if you ask after the challenge.  Also, I like the crop to keep the top of the hecktie in, but a slightly deeper depth of field to keep the entire tie crisp would accentuate the pinkness a bit more.</td>', 'Just a bit too bright on the upper left of the photo - pulls the eye there.  Maybe diffuse the light a little?  I''m hopeless with artificial light, but there are those on DPC who are very good and are more than willing to assist if you ask after the challenge.  Also, I like the crop to keep the top of the hecktie in, but a slightly deeper depth of field to keep the entire tie crisp would accentuate the pinkness a bit more.', '2013-10-10 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113703, 1085339, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see a single bit of a pink sign - the rest is pretty non-pink.</td>', 'I see a single bit of a pink sign - the rest is pretty non-pink.', '2013-10-10 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113704, 1085308, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost miniaturized.  I''m guessing it really isn''t all pink but has been made pink through processing.  Nice nightscape.</td>', 'Almost miniaturized.  I''m guessing it really isn''t all pink but has been made pink through processing.  Nice nightscape.', '2013-10-10 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113705, 1085988, 30982, '<td valign="top">They look rather discouraged, the poor dears.  I''m guessing this would be something one would use for a playbill perhaps?</td>', 'They look rather discouraged, the poor dears.  I''m guessing this would be something one would use for a playbill perhaps?', '2013-10-10 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113706, 1085133, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of this - very nice, and just the right amount of pink.</td>', 'I like the balance of this - very nice, and just the right amount of pink.', '2013-10-10 00:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113707, 1085317, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Wonderful balance of pink, and I just saw that same add for American Horror on a billboard here while riding in the blast-furnace heat that was Los Angeles on Sunday.  It''s always fun to make random connections to photographs, don''t you think?  Great poses from both of your subjects, by the way.</td>', 'Excellent!  Wonderful balance of pink, and I just saw that same add for American Horror on a billboard here while riding in the blast-furnace heat that was Los Angeles on Sunday.  It''s always fun to make random connections to photographs, don''t you think?  Great poses from both of your subjects, by the way.', '2013-10-10 00:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113708, 1086046, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, nice detail and good light.  It lacks a bit of tonal depth/balance, I think it is.  Can''t really put my finger on it.  But it works nicely for the challenge.</td>', 'Ah, nice detail and good light.  It lacks a bit of tonal depth/balance, I think it is.  Can''t really put my finger on it.  But it works nicely for the challenge.', '2013-10-10 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113709, 1085980, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting use of pink!  What are the cheek patches for?  You could crop off the right side just enough to cut off the partial arm - balances well and keeps the focus on those pretty green eyes.</td>', 'An interesting use of pink!  What are the cheek patches for?  You could crop off the right side just enough to cut off the partial arm - balances well and keeps the focus on those pretty green eyes.', '2013-10-10 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113710, 1084940, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost looks as though a flash were used, perhaps.  If so, a bit more diffusion and a bit more brightness in processing might make this sing a little more.</td>', 'Almost looks as though a flash were used, perhaps.  If so, a bit more diffusion and a bit more brightness in processing might make this sing a little more.', '2013-10-10 00:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113711, 1086035, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the pink petals!!  An excellent take on the challenge.</td>', 'Love the pink petals!!  An excellent take on the challenge.', '2013-10-10 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113713, 1086005, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool title, odd photo.  Not sure what I think of it.  The more I look at it, the more it glows.... Is that a good thing??</td>', 'Cool title, odd photo.  Not sure what I think of it.  The more I look at it, the more it glows.... Is that a good thing??', '2013-10-10 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113714, 1085946, 30982, '<td valign="top">No, you can''t.  If you eat it, you don''t have it anymore.  But you definitely should eat it because just having it is pointless!  I like the little heart.  And in fact, I think I''d like it without the cherry, which is a bit overpowering, though it does add a bit of a spark of color other than pink.</td>', 'No, you can''t.  If you eat it, you don''t have it anymore.  But you definitely should eat it because just having it is pointless!  I like the little heart.  And in fact, I think I''d like it without the cherry, which is a bit overpowering, though it does add a bit of a spark of color other than pink.', '2013-10-10 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113715, 1086063, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting plant!  Isolating it and showing even more detail might be cool.</td>', 'An interesting plant!  Isolating it and showing even more detail might be cool.', '2013-10-10 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113716, 1085955, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness.  He needs some air in those tires!</td>', 'Oh my goodness.  He needs some air in those tires!', '2013-10-10 00:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113717, 1085818, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another interesting pink cityscape.  I never knew there were so many pink cities!</td>', 'Another interesting pink cityscape.  I never knew there were so many pink cities!', '2013-10-10 00:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113718, 1085640, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Wonderful use of bokeh, excellent balance to the shot, and just a nice hint of pink.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely!  Wonderful use of bokeh, excellent balance to the shot, and just a nice hint of pink.  Well done.', '2013-10-10 00:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113719, 1085887, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha! Gotta quit drinkin'' so much....  Nice find!</td>', 'Ha! Gotta quit drinkin'' so much....  Nice find!', '2013-10-10 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113720, 1086011, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the very thick border.  Enough pink to support the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of the very thick border.  Enough pink to support the challenge.', '2013-10-10 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113721, 1085964, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent minimalistic approach while keeping shadows and texture and grain enough to prevent that studio look.  The color may be a bit forced (or desaturated) but it works here.  I like it!</td>', 'Excellent minimalistic approach while keeping shadows and texture and grain enough to prevent that studio look.  The color may be a bit forced (or desaturated) but it works here.  I like it!', '2013-10-10 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113722, 1085927, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice specimen and definitely in the pink family!  Seems a bit flatish - try punching up the brightness slider and see if it pops a bit more.</td>', 'Nice specimen and definitely in the pink family!  Seems a bit flatish - try punching up the brightness slider and see if it pops a bit more.', '2013-10-10 00:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113723, 1086042, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and soft.  I like the tall trunks behind supporting the horizontal branch - very nice balance.</td>', 'Very delicate and soft.  I like the tall trunks behind supporting the horizontal branch - very nice balance.', '2013-10-10 00:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113724, 1085794, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ewww!  Pinkish, and ewwww!  I like the poor kid being drug along just beyond.  And ewwww!</td>', 'Ewww!  Pinkish, and ewwww!  I like the poor kid being drug along just beyond.  And ewwww!', '2013-10-10 00:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113725, 1085753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would work well for stock - needs a bit of cleaning up with the wrinkles on the shirt and perhaps just a bit brighter?  Great use for that pair of giant lips you had hanging around, that''s for sure!!</td>', 'Would work well for stock - needs a bit of cleaning up with the wrinkles on the shirt and perhaps just a bit brighter?  Great use for that pair of giant lips you had hanging around, that''s for sure!!', '2013-10-10 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113727, 1085984, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of the better de-sat-ish kinda shots - nicely emphasizes the pink tongue and is a great headshot too!  My only nit is the slightly greenish tinge this gives to the fur in spots.</td>', 'One of the better de-sat-ish kinda shots - nicely emphasizes the pink tongue and is a great headshot too!  My only nit is the slightly greenish tinge this gives to the fur in spots.', '2013-10-10 00:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113728, 1084926, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the stances of your two main subjects.  Not entirely sold on the desaturation/coloration used to create the pink and meet the challenge.</td>', 'Love the stances of your two main subjects.  Not entirely sold on the desaturation/coloration used to create the pink and meet the challenge.', '2013-10-10 00:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113729, 1085979, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely, natural shot - looks like an awesome day to be out!</td>', 'Lovely, natural shot - looks like an awesome day to be out!', '2013-10-10 00:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113730, 1085264, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail, and like the old fashioned rose.  One nit - cropped just a bit too close at the top - needs a bit of room there to breathe.</td>', 'Very nice detail, and like the old fashioned rose.  One nit - cropped just a bit too close at the top - needs a bit of room there to breathe.', '2013-10-10 00:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113731, 1085236, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m going to guess that they don''t really come in this color... but I''ll check.... hang on....<br/> <br/>Nope!  This is the only one on the internet!  But it''s quite convincing, and very well photographed!</td>', 'You know, I''m going to guess that they don''t really come in this color... but I''ll check.... hang on.... Nope!  This is the only one on the internet!  But it''s quite convincing, and very well photographed!', '2013-10-10 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113758, 1085987, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good sentiment and serves the challenge well.</td>', 'A good sentiment and serves the challenge well.', '2013-10-10 01:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113759, 1085949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely.  Light is handled well, as is depth of field.</td>', 'Quite lovely.  Light is handled well, as is depth of field.', '2013-10-10 01:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113760, 1085816, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love cyclamen - I like the way you''ve framed this with the green in the corners - nice balance!</td>', 'I love cyclamen - I like the way you''ve framed this with the green in the corners - nice balance!', '2013-10-10 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113761, 1085238, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed!  An odd color combination and an interesting find!</td>', 'Indeed!  An odd color combination and an interesting find!', '2013-10-10 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113762, 1085718, 30982, '<td valign="top">They seem very joyful!</td>', 'They seem very joyful!', '2013-10-10 02:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113764, 1085894, 30982, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite figure what the green is - a carpet of some kind?   Cheerful!</td>', 'Can''t quite figure what the green is - a carpet of some kind?   Cheerful!', '2013-10-10 02:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113765, 1085748, 30982, '<td valign="top">Conveys a sense of urgency to me - somewhere I forgot I need to be.</td>', 'Conveys a sense of urgency to me - somewhere I forgot I need to be.', '2013-10-10 02:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113766, 1085897, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous flower - almost seems to glow!</td>', 'Gorgeous flower - almost seems to glow!', '2013-10-10 02:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113768, 1085965, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sultry!  Even her skin seems to go with the pink theme.</td>', 'Sultry!  Even her skin seems to go with the pink theme.', '2013-10-10 02:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113770, 1085821, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice grouping with a simple but pleasing balance.  I like that it''s processed naturally, too.</td>', 'A nice grouping with a simple but pleasing balance.  I like that it''s processed naturally, too.', '2013-10-10 02:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113771, 1085227, 30982, '<td valign="top">The little flying golden bits add a nice touch!</td>', 'The little flying golden bits add a nice touch!', '2013-10-10 02:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113773, 1085583, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a stomach more than a heart.  :-)</td>', 'Looks like a stomach more than a heart.  :-)', '2013-10-10 02:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113774, 1085957, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not many graffiti artists use pink.  Nice find!</td>', 'Not many graffiti artists use pink.  Nice find!', '2013-10-10 02:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113777, 1085912, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pleasing still life arrangement.  Seems just a tad "soft" as far as focus on the blooms.</td>', 'A pleasing still life arrangement.  Seems just a tad "soft" as far as focus on the blooms.', '2013-10-10 02:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113778, 1085750, 30982, '<td valign="top">High key works nicely here.  Very real.</td>', 'High key works nicely here.  Very real.', '2013-10-10 02:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113781, 1085311, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2013-10-10 02:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113783, 1086010, 30982, '<td valign="top">Whisperly pink.  But musical, too.</td>', 'Whisperly pink.  But musical, too.', '2013-10-10 02:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113784, 1085787, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic rose with water drops, though the dark bits in the center look like alien eyes, which is just a bit disconcerting....</td>', 'Classic rose with water drops, though the dark bits in the center look like alien eyes, which is just a bit disconcerting....', '2013-10-10 02:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113785, 1086069, 30982, '<td valign="top">Creative design!  I think it would make for a nice card, but you need just a tad more room at the bottom, and the background needs to be just a bit brighter.</td>', 'Creative design!  I think it would make for a nice card, but you need just a tad more room at the bottom, and the background needs to be just a bit brighter.', '2013-10-10 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113786, 1085806, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and very nice work with the light!</td>', 'Beautiful model and very nice work with the light!', '2013-10-10 02:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113787, 1086029, 30982, '<td valign="top">Reminds of the guy whose name starts with E - we did a challenge about him once.  It''ll come to me... Weston.  Though that doesn''t start with an E.  His first name does, perhaps?  Nice contrast in textures.  The rose may be a tad orange-ish for some.  Has pinks in it though!</td>', 'Reminds of the guy whose name starts with E - we did a challenge about him once.  It''ll come to me... Weston.  Though that doesn''t start with an E.  His first name does, perhaps?  Nice contrast in textures.  The rose may be a tad orange-ish for some.  Has pinks in it though!', '2013-10-10 02:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113788, 1086012, 30982, '<td valign="top">Do they tint the water in honor of breast cancer awareness?  That''s pretty cool!</td>', 'Do they tint the water in honor of breast cancer awareness?  That''s pretty cool!', '2013-10-10 02:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113789, 1085707, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, how lovely.  Best of show for me.</td>', 'Oh, how lovely.  Best of show for me.', '2013-10-10 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113790, 1085595, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Look at all those people!</td>', 'Awesome!  Look at all those people!', '2013-10-10 02:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113791, 1085843, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2013-10-10 02:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7113793, 1085998, 161751, '<td valign="top">Very elegant.  Spot on focus, muted tones, slight vignetting and short depth of field really make this feel like art.  10</td>', 'Very elegant.  Spot on focus, muted tones, slight vignetting and short depth of field really make this feel like art.  10', '2013-10-10 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
