(7115472, 1085996, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love it when men are confident enough to wear pink.  Way to show your support!  Nice crop and great color choices for contrast.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love it when men are confident enough to wear pink.  Way to show your support!  Nice crop and great color choices for contrast.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2013-10-14 02:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
