(7116111, 1085996, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Power pink indeed - I like that this is something different from the rest. I like how it shows the action of getting ready for the day tightening the tie. It is a good shot but needs a little attention in the light department in balancing the play of light. The left half has too much light causing details and highlights to blow out while the right bottom has too little causing deep shadows. If you can be sure to balance your lights so that there is even lighting all around. If you have a histogram function on your camera that will tell you if some areas are blown out or too dark.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Power pink indeed - I like that this is something different from the rest. I like how it shows the action of getting ready for the day tightening the tie. It is a good shot but needs a little attention in the light department in balancing the play of light. The left half has too much light causing details and highlights to blow out while the right bottom has too little causing deep shadows. If you can be sure to balance your lights so that there is even lighting all around. If you have a histogram function on your camera that will tell you if some areas are blown out or too dark.', '2013-10-15 22:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116112, 1085719, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract, though it looks more orangey on my monitor.</td>', 'Cool abstract, though it looks more orangey on my monitor.', '2013-10-15 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7116113, 1085887, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Well this is a  fun image and a very different balloon! Wonder what the trunk of this pink elephant makes it hard or easy to ''steer'' with the wind currents. Anyway great color! I do have one suggestion that could help improve the composition a bit - since the main subject is the pink elephant balloon I think it would keep attention focused on it if you composed it on the vertical. A vertical frame would also complement the vertical shape of the hot air balloon.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Well this is a  fun image and a very different balloon! Wonder what the trunk of this pink elephant makes it hard or easy to ''steer'' with the wind currents. Anyway great color! I do have one suggestion that could help improve the composition a bit - since the main subject is the pink elephant balloon I think it would keep attention focused on it if you composed it on the vertical. A vertical frame would also complement the vertical shape of the hot air balloon.', '2013-10-15 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
