(7117233, 1085750, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/>This image is beautiful! I give it a 15 on a scale of 1 to 10. (for the following reason)<br/>The image is artistic, creative and very nicely processed/it is a perfect example of photojournalism as it documents a sign of our times, it is very difficult to cover both aspects in an image. This is what makes for great photography, I know it is hard when it comes from your core, thats what makes it moving for the viewer.<br/>An unforgettable photograph! Hats off to you!!!</td>', 'Congratulations!This image is beautiful! I give it a 15 on a scale of 1 to 10. (for the following reason)The image is artistic, creative and very nicely processed/it is a perfect example of photojournalism as it documents a sign of our times, it is very difficult to cover both aspects in an image. This is what makes for great photography, I know it is hard when it comes from your core, thats what makes it moving for the viewer.An unforgettable photograph! Hats off to you!!!', '2013-10-17 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 0),
